---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  path="/privacy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Northlatch Labs LLC software and northlatch.tech."
>
  <section class="page-hero" style="padding-bottom:28px">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
      <p class="cmd">Governance</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">What information we collect, how our contact inquiry endpoint operates, and how to request access or deletion.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="border-top:0;padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
      <div class="doc-card">
        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Information We Store</h2>
          <p>Account email, billing details, service usage counters, and support conversations. That is the entire list.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Contact Form Processing</h2>
          <p>The inquiry form on <a href="/contact" class="accent">/contact</a> posts directly to this site's first-party endpoint (<code>/api/contact.js</code>). Your name, email, topic, optional company, and message are validated on our server and delivered as a single email to <code>hello@projectxprotocol.dev</code> through Resend, our transactional email processor. Messages are stored by Resend as email and nowhere else; this website keeps no form database. The hidden honeypot field is checked solely on the server for spam prevention and never transmitted.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Information We Never Store</h2>
          <p>We never store wallet private keys, recovery seed phrases, or the contents of third-party on-chain traffic.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Third-Party Processors</h2>
          <p>We rely on Stripe for payment processing, Resend for transactional email (the contact form's sole external hop), and AWS us-east-1 alongside Vercel for hosting infrastructure. None receive more data than required to operate.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-section">
          <h2>Data Retention &amp; Your Rights</h2>
          <p>Account records are kept while your account remains active and deleted within 30 days of closure, except where retention is required for tax compliance. You may request access, export, or deletion at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:privacy@projectxprotocol.dev" class="accent">privacy@projectxprotocol.dev</a>.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-meta">Last updated 2026-11-25 &middot; Northlatch Labs LLC</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
